.TH ZERODDS-AMQP-BRIDGED 1 "2026-05-06" "1.0.0-rc.1" "ZeroDDS Manual"
.SH NAME
zerodds-amqp-bridged \- DDS to AMQP 1.0 bridge daemon
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B zerodds-amqp-bridged
[\fB\-c\fR \fIFILE\fR]
[\fB\-\-validate\-only\fR]
[\fB\-V\fR | \fB\-h\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B zerodds-amqp-bridged
bridges DDS topics to AMQP 1.0 endpoints. Supports SASL ANONYMOUS, PLAIN,
EXTERNAL, TLS, links with sender/receiver settle modes, and
property-based routing. Implements
.IR zerodds-amqp-bridge-daemon-1.0 (7).
.SH OPTIONS
.BR \-c , \-\-log\-level , \-\-validate\-only , \-V , \-h .
.SH SIGNALS
SIGTERM, SIGHUP.
.SH FILES
.I /etc/zerodds/amqp-bridged.yaml .
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR zerodds-amqp-bridged.yaml (5).
.SH AUTHORS
ZeroDDS Contributors.
